WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:08.087
For larger fleets, prepare devices in a batch. Each device
receives its own single-use setup credential before first boot.

2
00:00:08.690 --> 00:00:13.106
Choose Enrollment to prepare devices during manufacturing or
provisioning.

3
00:00:13.690 --> 00:00:20.261
Set a device limit and expiry before creating a policy. This
example reuses an existing policy.

4
00:00:20.850 --> 00:00:25.373
Paste a roster with names and serial numbers, then check it
before continuing.

5
00:00:25.970 --> 00:00:32.327
Download the credentials and store them securely. This is the
only download of these one-use setup keys.

6
00:00:32.930 --> 00:00:38.946
Register the reserved devices and approve the request. Give each
device only its own credential.

7
00:00:39.530 --> 00:00:46.250
The reservations are ready. Devices complete enrollment when
their configured clients start with those credentials.

8
00:00:46.850 --> 00:00:53.719
The batch is prepared. Each device still needs its own
credential and the configured client to enroll at first boot.
